# open-simh-extended/tests/dmv11_vmsload/setup.cmd  v2 (v2: comments start with #, which vmsrun.py skips; with ! they went to DCL) (2026-11-21)
# DCL commands for vmsrun.py, run once: copy HELLO.TSK from the tape to
# SYS$SYSTEM and define line, circuit and the node PDP (1.5) in the
# permanent database.  Password 7B hex = 123, the PDP-11's E113 setting.
MOUNT/FOREIGN/BLOCKSIZE=512/RECORDSIZE=512 MSA0:
COPY MSA0: SYS$SYSTEM:HELLO.TSK
DISMOUNT MSA0:
MC NCP PURGE KNOWN CIRCUITS ALL
MC NCP PURGE KNOWN LINES ALL
MC NCP DEFINE LINE DMP-0 STATE ON PROTOCOL DDCMP POINT
MC NCP DEFINE CIRCUIT DMP-0 STATE ON SERVICE ENABLED
MC NCP DEFINE NODE 1.5 NAME PDP SERVICE CIRCUIT DMP-0 SERVICE PASSWORD 7B SERVICE DEVICE DMV CPU PDP11
MC NCP DEFINE NODE PDP SECONDARY LOADER SYS$SYSTEM:HELLO.TSK LOAD FILE SYS$SYSTEM:HELLO.TSK
MC NCP LIST NODE PDP CHARACTERISTICS
